WEBVTT

00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:03.980
Wow, flowers!

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:06.510
So pretty!

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.050
Hey, Rikka.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:15.790
Hm?

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:18.060
When you grow up,

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:19.270
what do you want to be?

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:27.010
I wanna be a doctor like Mommy!

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.840
I want to help sick people get better!

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.480
Hey, traveling the world as a photographer like me is pretty fun, too!

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:39.600
I wanna be like Mommy!

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:42.600
Thank you, that makes me happy.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:49.160
But being a doctor takes looooooooooads of studying!

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:50.730
It's no cakewalk!

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:52.930
I can handle it!

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:54.750
I see...

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:59.310
I'm gonna study really hard!

00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:01.230
And I'm gonna be a doctor!

00:01:05.930 --> 00:01:08.610
Oh, the test results are out.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.480
And Rikka's in first place, right?

