00:01:20.270 --> 00:01:20.980
Huh?

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:23.480
Huuuuuuuh?!

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:31.210
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:33.690
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:36.560
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:38.580
Every day it sparkles

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:42.300
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:49.170
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:54.830
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:54.990 --> 00:02:00.460
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:05.900
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:11.610
If your friends are in trouble

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:20.490
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:22.150
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:24.560
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:27.400
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:30.210
What's more than just cute

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:34.070
is our promise between girls

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:40.110
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:46.030
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:58.020
A Dream or a Promise?

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:58.020
A Dream or a Promise?

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:59.720
Solitaire

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:03.460
I feel like I shouldn't say anything...

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:05.230
Rikka...

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:07.290
We should gently leave her be.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:09.660
That's right...

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:12.280
This jewel may be mysterious,

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:15.440
but I feel like I've seen it in Trump Kingdom's castle.

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:17.670
Could it be a Royal Crystal?

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:19.380
What might that be?

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:24.480
It's a legendary jewel that only the royal family is allowed to possess.

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:27.390
There are five crystals in all,

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:31.140
and it's said that something amazing will happen when all are gathered together!

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:36.080
And this is a Royal Crystal...

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:38.860
Or it looks like it, at least.

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:43.200
I've only seen them once myself, so I can't say for sure.

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.600
Not much to do about that.

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:50.280
Sorry, I'm kinda hungry.

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:51.520
Oh yeah!

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:55.170
Mom said to get everyone together for dinner!

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:56.620
Oh, splendid!

00:03:56.910 --> 00:03:58.080
How about you, Rikka?

00:03:58.080 --> 00:03:59.550
Sorry...

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:04.640
I have things to do, so I'll leave early.

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:07.620
Wait for me!

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:10.000
I'm a tad worried.

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:14.300
diner

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:14.300
Pig's Tail

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:14.300
I'm home!

00:04:14.740 --> 00:04:16.610
Oh, welcome home.

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:18.500
Who's this?

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:20.390
Rikka's mom!

00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:24.460
Are you done with work today?

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:25.610
No.

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:27.510
When I get a break,

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:31.220
I need to go back home for a change of clothes and go right back to the hospital.

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:32.410
Sounds busy.

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:34.110
The hospital?

00:04:34.110 --> 00:04:38.490
Rikka's mother works at a large hospital as a doctor.

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:40.630
Is Yuuzou doing well?

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:43.080
According to his letters, yes.

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:45.670
You don't need to worry about him.

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:51.370
But Rikka, on the other hand...

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:53.470
What happened to Rikka?!

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.440
Well, uh...

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:59.070
It's not anything... big, really.

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:05.480
I just hear her shouting suddenly from her room,

00:05:09.930 --> 00:05:13.290
or sleep talking in some strange language,

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:16.060
so I wonder if she's all right.

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:27.360
Sorry, I've got stuff I need to do, so I'll go on ahead.

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:28.910
Wait, Rikka!

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:34.410
What's up with Rikka?

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:38.920
Is she that torn up about not being first on the exam?

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:41.700
It's more than that to Rikka.

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:45.660
She dreams of being a great doctor like her mom.

00:05:45.660 --> 00:05:50.200
And to do that, you have to be smart enough to rank first in the school!

00:05:50.940 --> 00:05:53.890
It's a real issue if her grades fall!

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:55.170
Is that so?

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:59.260
Rikka's mom is worried too,

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:01.170
so I wonder what the problem is.

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:03.590
There's only one answer!

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:04.910
Answer?

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:06.100
That is...

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:07.150
What is?

00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:09.550
Rikka's gone bad!

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:10.520
Huh?

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:12.470
I've seen it on TV!

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:16.350
Kids her age go rotten at the smallest chances!

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:18.890
Whatchoo lookin' at?!

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:20.490
No way.

00:06:20.490 --> 00:06:23.330
Bad news!

00:06:26.470 --> 00:06:30.520
We saw Rikka walk into a big building earlier!

00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:35.770
And we heard lots of loud, serious slapping sounds!

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:37.980
She's... fighting!

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:39.610
She's a bad apple!

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:41.170
It can't be true!

00:06:41.970 --> 00:06:44.190
This is the place!

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:49.720
Your whole life's ahead of you, Rikka!

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:54.350
Huh?

00:06:56.160 --> 00:06:57.600
It's you girls...

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:06.100
The tail feathers of the copper pheasant are long,

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:00.990
Competitive karuta?

00:07:00.990 --> 00:07:02.130
What's that?

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:06.840
It's a game where you take cards based on the poems from the Hundred Poets.

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:11.390
long as the nights I spend alone

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:08.620
It's not just a game! {#esports}

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:10.210
Sorry.

00:07:10.210 --> 00:07:13.040
Competitive karuta is a full-fledged sport.

00:07:13.380 --> 00:07:16.840
So, the shouting in your room was...

00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:18.950
Me practicing with Rachel.

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:21.140
Who's a rotten apple, now?

00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:27.570
But I did not know you had begun playing karuta.

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:31.810
I got interested when I read a book on the Hundred Poets.

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:33.330
I read it for my studies,

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:37.740
but all of the bittersweet love poems stole my heart!

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:39.870
I couldn't put it down!

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:42.170
And while I was researching it,

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:44.230
I learned about competitive karuta.

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:46.610
And she registered here before I knew it!

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:49.040
How very like you, Rikka.

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:51.920
So that's why your studies have been lacking. {Note: Her studies don't take a hit from Precuring, but they do from playing children's card games.}

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:55.090
Yeah, that's the thing.

00:07:55.090 --> 00:07:57.700
I want to become a doctor,

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:00.830
so I don't have the time for distractions.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:02.460
Rikka...

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:04.460
That was the plan, at least!

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:09.380
But it's so fun that I can't stop!

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:11.870
But... I'm planning to quit.

00:08:12.810 --> 00:08:16.570
Nothing's more important to me than my promise with Mom.

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:23.580
In a week, they'll hold a match against the queen.

