I'll test my strength there,

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:27.750
and then I'll quit!

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:29.980
Rikka, this queen...

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:33.680
She's the strongest female karuta player in the country.

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:37.760
The princess enjoyed karuta as well, and played it often...

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:40.420
There might be a clue there!

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:44.300
