00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:04.480
are memorization, precision, and endurance.

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:08.150
I have crafted a training schedule for this week.

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:10.560
The rules of a match are simple.

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:13.820
Line up 25 cards on each player's sides.

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:17.000
The player who takes all of her cards first, wins. {I thought it continued until all cards were gone?}{no, it goes until one player takes 25}

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:21.870
You have fifteen minutes to memorize your arrangements.

00:09:22.180 --> 00:09:24.060
That short?

