 Fun English

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:26.900
Hello, Ishikawa speaking.

00:10:27.820 --> 00:10:28.520
Oh?

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:31.980
Rub my shoulders.

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:32.890
Right away.

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:35.190
Where's my melon juice?

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:37.590
Get it yourself.

00:10:37.590 --> 00:10:39.370
Right here, Madam Regina.

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:41.450
Don't be a brown-noser!

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:45.720
Really, King Selfish's daughter, here?

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:47.030
Nobody told me!

00:10:47.030 --> 00:10:49.660
Hey, buy me some cream puffs.

00:10:49.660 --> 00:10:50.330
Excuse me?

00:10:51.180 --> 00:10:52.880
If that's how you'll be,

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:54.550
I'll tell Daddy on you.

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:01.210
Ira! Bring your stuff!

00:11:02.610 --> 00:11:03.840
Where is he?!

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:09.450
Thank you.

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:12.480
I feel like I've improved because of your help.

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:16.370
She said "Good luck."

00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:21.950
It's the queen!

00:11:22.930 --> 00:11:25.030
Good day, everyone.

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:27.070
That woman is...

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:29.650
The queen. {You don't say. Also, Rikka says this line, hence the caps.}

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:49.350
Now then, we shall begin our matches against the queen.

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:54.530
It's rare to get the chance to battle against the most skilled woman in the country.

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:57.090
Treat it as a good experience.

00:11:57.090 --> 00:11:57.940
Yes.

00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:07.110
I can feel the tension from here.

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:14.910
The waves are gathered

00:12:15.850 --> 00:12:17.440
The queen got one?

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:18.650
She's fast.

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:20.120
It drives the grass

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:21.720
Though I did not pray

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:22.950
As I wait for her

00:12:28.630 --> 00:12:30.460
Thank you very much.

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:35.240
That's how the queen plays...

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:38.630
That was really intense!

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:40.570
It was just like a sport!

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:42.520
She wasn't just fast.

00:12:42.520 --> 00:12:45.440
It's how she set up her cards, too.

00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:47.080
She's on a whole different level!

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:50.450
I won't stand a chance against her!

00:12:50.780 --> 00:12:52.180
Rikka...

00:12:52.550 --> 00:12:54.180
That woman...

00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:55.590
What about her?

00:12:57.230 --> 00:12:59.590
I knew I felt something about her.

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:01.390
Can I get an autograph?

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:03.060
I'm sorry.

00:13:03.060 --> 00:13:05.340
I decline such offers.

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:06.750
I see...

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:15.890
Because you said you were coming, I awaited you,

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:19.140
but only the moon came to greet me at the cold light of dawn!

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:24.080
Everyone praises and esteems me!

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:27.120
And yet, why?

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:32.130
Why am I a queen with no king to match me?

00:13:32.850 --> 00:13:35.360
It's because every man in the world is too weak!

00:13:35.360 --> 00:13:38.600
That's why I'll never find love!

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:45.870
No, it's because I'm too picky and set hurdles too high.

00:13:47.770 --> 00:13:49.890
Aw, just be picky.

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:53.410
I will grant your desire.

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:06.460
Grant me your darkness!

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:21.910
I think I'll get serious.

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:23.840
What?

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:25.960
I felt a dark heartbeat!

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:32.920
It's you!

00:14:32.920 --> 00:14:34.620
Let's go, everyone!

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:38.230
Charles!

00:14:39.410 --> 00:14:42.190
Precure Love Link!

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:43.940
L-O-V-E!

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:44.660
L-O-V-E!

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:45.360
L-O-V-E!

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:46.420
L-O-V-E!

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:14.330
Brimming with love,

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:16.480
Cure Heart!

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:20.830
The light of wisdom,

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:22.980
Cure Diamond!

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:27.260
The warmth of the sun,

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:29.310
Cure Rosetta!

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:32.520
The blade of courage,

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:34.650
Cure Sword!

00:15:37.590 --> 00:15:39.680
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:15:40.340 --> 00:15:41.990
Dokidoki Precure!

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:46.060
Oh poor karuta card who has lost her love, {It's hard to tell whether I should use his or her given the nature of Beast Mode.}

00:15:46.610 --> 00:15:48.210
I, Cure Heart,

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:51.390
will make your heart race once more!

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:53.510
There you are!

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:57.300
You insolent children dare challenge me?

00:15:58.070 --> 00:15:59.190
Very well!

00:15:59.190 --> 00:16:01.260
We shall battle in karuta!

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:02.140
Huh?

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:04.310
Hey, who said you could—

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:07.200
Come to me, my karuta cards!

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:08.680
Listen to me!

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:13.720
Now, we fight!

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:15.290
We're playing karuta?!

00:16:15.810 --> 00:16:18.010
The only relief

00:16:17.320 --> 00:16:18.790
Found it!

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:21.370
Aaaaaah!

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:22.390
Cure Heart!

00:16:22.760 --> 00:16:25.100
Even the gaps in the shutters are too cruel to let the dawn's light in

00:16:26.330 --> 00:16:28.290
We have to get the cards first!

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:37.050
Under a thatched roof of a makeshift hut in an autumn field

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:30.260
It's that one!

00:16:30.910 --> 00:16:32.940
Get "My sleeves are wet, not just from the dew!"

00:16:33.610 --> 00:16:34.670
This one?

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:38.030
Unfortunate.

00:16:38.030 --> 00:16:42.110
That one is "My life passes by in vain as I watch the long rains fall."

00:16:42.110 --> 00:16:44.000
It's the wrong card!

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:46.700
I'll give you one of mine!

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:48.620
Cure Sword!

00:16:48.930 --> 00:16:51.260
For you, I head out

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:51.260
I know this one!

00:16:53.960 --> 00:16:55.330
That's cheating!

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:57.190
This is known as covering! {Or whatever the technique is called}{they actually haven't used this word in chihaya (but blocking is close enough)}{Really? I could have sworn they did it in S1.}{they use something else because i dont recognize it at all}{The word, you mean?}{yes}{Found a Chihayafuru wiki that translates it to this.}

00:16:57.190 --> 00:16:58.530
It is a legitimate technique!

00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:02.330
Soon I will cease to be

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:01.850
There!

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.900
Spring has passed

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:04.940
There!

00:17:05.190 --> 00:17:07.710
When I look up

00:17:06.270 --> 00:17:07.710
Theeere!

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:09.590
Is it the same moon that rose on Mount Mikasa?

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:12.780
You're stealin' too much spotlight.

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:15.610
We can't put up a fight!

00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:19.970
<i>We're fighting the queen.</i>

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:21.790
<i>Of course I can't...</i>

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:25.960
It's all right.

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:29.220
That's right.

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:31.570
You practiced hard.

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:34.200
We're rooting for you.

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:35.420
You girls...

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:37.800
Cure Diamond,

00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:40.200
show us the fruits of your effort!

00:17:42.550 --> 00:17:43.590
Got it!

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:54.880
Flower's colors have faded away
While in idle thought,

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:49.950
This one...

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:52.080
is the one I got wrong before!

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:57.120
I won't allow you!

00:18:04.960 --> 00:18:06.960
Cure Diamond!

00:18:09.360 --> 00:18:11.870
How could this be?

00:18:11.870 --> 00:18:13.340
I got it!

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:15.560
Ouch!

00:18:16.560 --> 00:18:17.710
Cure Heart!

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:19.870
Love Heart Arrow!

00:18:29.770 --> 00:18:32.610
Precure Heart Shoot!

00:18:43.630 --> 00:18:45.860
Waaaah!

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:52.380
Drat!

00:18:52.380 --> 00:18:54.010
Today's been a complete mess!

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:13.630
Thank you very much.

00:19:14.650 --> 00:19:17.580
It's been a while since I've had such a fun match.

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:20.500
But you've got a long way to go before you can defeat me.

00:19:21.270 --> 00:19:23.010
Here, take these.

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:25.280
They're my favorite cards.

00:19:25.280 --> 00:19:26.850
Practice with these.

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:30.060
Thank you very much!

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:31.150
Goodbye, then.

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:35.130
The queen was really strong!

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:37.350
But you put up a good fight!

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:41.090
The cards?!

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:46.210
A Royal Crystal?

00:19:54.550 --> 00:19:56.070
My, how pretty!

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:02.750
It's too bad.

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:06.610
Mom, what are you doing here?

00:20:06.610 --> 00:20:10.150
Don't think you can pull the wool over your mother's eyes.

00:20:10.150 --> 00:20:11.510
It's not what you think!

00:20:11.510 --> 00:20:14.100
Rikka didn't mean anything bad...

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:16.690
There's a <i>good</i> explanation for this...

00:20:18.060 --> 00:20:19.830
I'm sorry I lied to you.

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:22.200
But I'm done now.

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:25.900
I'll go back to studying to be a doctor!

00:20:28.530 --> 00:20:30.240
Really, this girl.

00:20:31.900 --> 00:20:33.230
I'm sorry.

00:20:41.650 --> 00:20:43.790
I'm not mad at all.

00:20:44.540 --> 00:20:47.490
It's good that you found something fun.

00:20:47.730 --> 00:20:49.150
Mom?

00:20:49.150 --> 00:20:51.340
You're still a child,

00:20:51.340 --> 00:20:53.610
so do what you want.

00:20:53.610 --> 00:20:56.070
If you like karuta, feel free to continue.

00:20:56.070 --> 00:20:58.710
And if you find something else you like,

00:20:58.710 --> 00:21:00.670
put everything you've got into it, too!

00:21:00.990 --> 00:21:03.870
You can do anything you put your mind to.

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:09.650
That's right.

00:21:09.650 --> 00:21:12.020
It's good to have a lot of dreams.

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:15.590
Like wanting to be a photographer over a doctor!

00:21:15.800 --> 00:21:16.870
Dad!

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:18.080
I'm back.

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:22.030
Your father just called last night to say he'd be home the next day.

00:21:22.450 --> 00:21:25.150
Doing what you want too much can be a real bother.

00:21:25.150 --> 00:21:27.200
Aww, it's no problem.

00:21:27.200 --> 00:21:29.230
I've got a lot of stories to tell.

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:31.150
Huh?

00:21:31.150 --> 00:21:33.460
And I'd like to hear some of your stories, Rikka.

00:21:33.460 --> 00:21:34.810
Wait, Dad!

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:36.200
Me too!

00:21:36.200 --> 00:21:37.270
Mom, you too?

00:21:57.730 --> 00:22:00.630
I'm gonna try a bunch of different things!

00:22:27.060 --> 00:22:28.630
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:31.600
Super Busy!

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:31.600
Super Busy!

00:22:31.700 --> 00:22:33.700
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
